# Build context for both service images is the repository root, because packages/core is a
# workspace member both services import and a Railway Root Directory would cut it out of the
# context ("Railway will only pull down files from that directory").
#
# What is excluded is everything neither service reads at runtime. data/ is NOT excluded
# wholesale: seed_reference reads data/raw/hapi/admin2_NPL.json and data/sources-catalog.json,
# and ingest_orgs reads data/orgs/. The research archives underneath data/raw are excluded by
# name instead - 7.9 MB of them, none read by any job.
.git
.gitignore
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.env
.env.*
apps/web
node_modules
docs
tests
**/tests
data/raw/ukcc
data/raw/ukcc_api
data/raw/ukcc_bulk_extra
data/raw/iati
data/raw/swc
data/raw/de_watchdogs
data/raw/us_watchdogs
data/raw/fts
data/case-studies
*.md
!README.md
